# The IronRDP release Relay's remote desktop client is built from (see desktop/scripts/build-ironrdp.sh).
# tag:    a release tag of github.com/Devolutions/IronRDP for the iron-remote-desktop-rdp web package.
# commit: the full commit that tag must point to. The build refuses a tag that has moved.
